{"id": "70440", "title": "一婚又一婚", "author": "温韭", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 37, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/70/70440/70440s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/70/70440.htm", "intro": "高承爵想跟梁馨求婚，可偏偏每次都张不开口，每次都是被虐后摔门离开，求婚失败。\r\n    腹黑毒舌，冷漠深沉，别扭傲娇……高承爵最常说的一句话便是：\r\n    “梁馨，你给我等着，我早晚能把你娶回家，让你给我们老高家生一窝孙子！”\r\n    为此，在想要把梁馨娶回家的路上，他做了很多荒唐事……\r\n    总结→萌男萌女极品狗血事儿。轻松文。", "base": "files/article/html/70/70440", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "001章 爸爸", "file": "10968566.html", "available": false}, {"title": "002章 归来", "file": "10968567.html", "available": false}, {"title": "003章 乐否", "file": "10968568.html", "available": false}, {"title": "004章 做了", "file": "10968569.html", "available": false}, {"title": "005章 坏了", "file": "10968570.html", "available": false}, {"title": "006章 乱了", "file": "10968571.html", "available": false}, {"title": "007章 睡否", "file": "10968572.html", "available": false}, {"title": "008章 相亲", "file": "10968573.html", "available": false}, {"title": "009章 狗血", "file": "10968574.html", "available": false}, {"title": "010章 发狠", "file": "10968575.html", "available": false}, {"title": "011章 车里", "file": "10968576.html", "available": false}, {"title": "012章 交锋", "file": "10968577.html", "available": false}, {"title": "013章 孩子", "file": "10968578.html", "available": false}, {"title": "014章 往事", "file": "10968579.html", "available": false}, {"title": "015章 离婚", "file": "10968580.html", "available": false}, {"title": "016章 过渡", "file": "10968581.html", "available": false}, {"title": "017章 聚会", "file": "10968582.html", "available": false}, {"title": "018章 遇见", "file": "10968583.html", "available": false}, {"title": "019章 上门", "file": "10968584.html", "available": false}, {"title": "020章 被虐", "file": "10968585.html", "available": false}, {"title": "021章 过渡", "file": "10968586.html", "available": false}, {"title": "022章 说了", "file": "10968587.html", "available": false}, {"title": "23-26", "file": "10968588